#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/aci.rst:10
msgid ""
"Add ACI as a network and security integration. Inventory your existing "
"ACI configurations. Create networks, bridge domains, application "
"profiles, tenants, endpoint groups, contexts, filters and contracts.  "
"Provision instances into new endpoint groups and define security groups "
"that apply contracts on provision."
msgstr "Adicione o ACI como uma integração de rede e segurança. Inventarie suas configurações ACI existentes. Crie redes, bridge domains, application profiles, tenants, endpoint groups, contexts, filters e contracts. Provisione instâncias em novos endpoint groups e defina security groups que aplicam contracts no provisionamento."

